# fifo_frame_length_11_stale: A header of length 11, one short of the header, is skipped as length 0 is, and the stale bytes after it parse.Two NOPs, then a header with a bad length as the only command the doorbell counts. The ring bytes after it, which 0x1008 never counts, hold a NOP (stamp 3) and then a command whose barrier waits on stamp slot 5 for 1, which nothing signals: the FIFO parses the stale NOP, publishes stamp 3, advances 0x100c past 0x1008, and blocks in the barrier.
